<div class="wrap page-intro prose">
  <h1>Thank you</h1>
  <span class="gc-knife" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <p>Your message reached Gene. He’ll get back to you by email.</p>
  <p><a href="/" id="back-link">Back to the home page</a></p>
